(6048031, 888285, 43774, '<td valign="top">.....and the children drank lemonade...."<br/> <br/>Interesting perspective, blown out lights are a bit distracting. Photo seems to have an odd colour tint to it, sort of pinkish. A bit grainy too, but it''s your unique perspective that makes this shot.<br/> <br/>Oh, and I''ve never seen a pipe organ in a Salvation Army Church before but I don''t think this ia a SA church. :)</td>', '.....and the children drank lemonade...." Interesting perspective, blown out lights are a bit distracting. Photo seems to have an odd colour tint to it, sort of pinkish. A bit grainy too, but it''s your unique perspective that makes this shot. Oh, and I''ve never seen a pipe organ in a Salvation Army Church before but I don''t think this ia a SA church. :)', '2010-06-09 09:30:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(6048035, 889441, 99710, '<td valign="top">nice photo, well-composed. i am not fan of the borders though, i think the photo can do without it.</td>', 'nice photo, well-composed. i am not fan of the borders though, i think the photo can do without it.', '2010-06-09 09:31:54.000000', NULL, 1),
