(6049762, 889801, 104009, '<td valign="top">interesting choice and crop 6</td>', 'interesting choice and crop 6', '2010-06-10 08:20:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(6049860, 889412, 35044, '<td valign="top">Pretty subject but image blurry and has too much colour - I suggest that you look into some methods of sharpening your images when you resize for submission.<br/> <br/>Also the image of the church is too tightly cropped and tilted.</td>', 'Pretty subject but image blurry and has too much colour - I suggest that you look into some methods of sharpening your images when you resize for submission. Also the image of the church is too tightly cropped and tilted.', '2010-06-10 11:19:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(6049861, 888146, 35044, '<td valign="top">Too yellow! Also too much local contrast makes this look over processed.  <br/> <br/>If you desaturated (especially the yellow channel) by 70-80% you''d have a much nicer image.</td>', 'Too yellow! Also too much local contrast makes this look over processed.   If you desaturated (especially the yellow channel) by 70-80% you''d have a much nicer image.', '2010-06-10 11:21:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(6049862, 889597, 35044, '<td valign="top">Focus is on a bit of uninteresting foreground - the rest is out of focus and this pretty subject is not done justice.  Also too yellow - try desaturating the yellow channel.</td>', 'Focus is on a bit of uninteresting foreground - the rest is out of focus and this pretty subject is not done justice.  Also too yellow - try desaturating the yellow channel.', '2010-06-10 11:22:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(6049863, 888081, 35044, '<td valign="top">Closed in this case is also uninteresting - not pretty or weathered or anything - just a closed church.</td>', 'Closed in this case is also uninteresting - not pretty or weathered or anything - just a closed church.', '2010-06-10 11:23:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(6049864, 888021, 35044, '<td valign="top">I get no sense of "church" from this.</td>', 'I get no sense of "church" from this.', '2010-06-10 11:24:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(6049865, 889857, 35044, '<td valign="top">Local contrast is way too high - gives an overprocessed look.</td>', 'Local contrast is way too high - gives an overprocessed look.', '2010-06-10 11:24:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(6049868, 889438, 35044, '<td valign="top">Hard to make breeze bllocks interesting and I''m afraid that this does little for me.  Time of day looks a bit middayish - not a flattering light.  Colours are washed out and there is not much by way of story to hold interest for long.</td>', 'Hard to make breeze bllocks interesting and I''m afraid that this does little for me.  Time of day looks a bit middayish - not a flattering light.  Colours are washed out and there is not much by way of story to hold interest for long.', '2010-06-10 11:26:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(6049869, 889420, 35044, '<td valign="top">The back door, in the shade, with all colour gone.  It''s not inviting me to score highly...</td>', 'The back door, in the shade, with all colour gone.  It''s not inviting me to score highly...', '2010-06-10 11:27:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(6049870, 889853, 35044, '<td valign="top">I like the image but it does not shout "church" to me.</td>', 'I like the image but it does not shout "church" to me.', '2010-06-10 11:28:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(6049872, 889669, 35044, '<td valign="top">I like this compposition but I wonder if yoou could give it a bit more punch in post processing?  Try adding a new "channel mixer" layer, tick the "monochrome" box, move the sliders (try pushing the blues very dark) to get a different contrast - and then set the channel mixer layer to "luminance".  You''ll get a really punchy look that I think would really suit this image.</td>', 'I like this compposition but I wonder if yoou could give it a bit more punch in post processing?  Try adding a new "channel mixer" layer, tick the "monochrome" box, move the sliders (try pushing the blues very dark) to get a different contrast - and then set the channel mixer layer to "luminance".  You''ll get a really punchy look that I think would really suit this image.', '2010-06-10 11:31:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(6049873, 888808, 35044, '<td valign="top">This feels tightly cropped (it is losing detail), and accordingly there is no excuse for not getting it straight!  Nice light so a shame that the final presentation is not as slick as it could be.</td>', 'This feels tightly cropped (it is losing detail), and accordingly there is no excuse for not getting it straight!  Nice light so a shame that the final presentation is not as slick as it could be.', '2010-06-10 11:32:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(6049874, 888308, 35044, '<td valign="top">Midday light is just too harsh here.</td>', 'Midday light is just too harsh here.', '2010-06-10 11:33:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(6049875, 888148, 35044, '<td valign="top">Really wonky photo! Since it is also obviously cropped - there is no excuse for that!</td>', 'Really wonky photo! Since it is also obviously cropped - there is no excuse for that!', '2010-06-10 11:34:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(6049876, 889548, 35044, '<td valign="top">Where is the church? :-) <br/> <br/>Your subject is not very visible, and so not very good for a challenge about churches!</td>', 'Where is the church? :-)  Your subject is not very visible, and so not very good for a challenge about churches!', '2010-06-10 11:34:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(6049879, 889398, 35044, '<td valign="top">Great subject and nice composition - but your image has lost clarity and detail in your processing.</td>', 'Great subject and nice composition - but your image has lost clarity and detail in your processing.', '2010-06-10 11:35:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(6049881, 888262, 35044, '<td valign="top">Nice photo, but does not scream "church" to me.</td>', 'Nice photo, but does not scream "church" to me.', '2010-06-10 11:35:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(6049890, 888952, 35044, '<td valign="top">Flash is ugly here (maybe try boucing it off the ceiling - wood will give a funny colour cast, but that is easier to fix than the dreadful lighting here).  <br/> <br/>Also not the prettiest of times to shoot - lots of people are distracting, as is the tripod.  Video screens are not pretty.  One or two people in this room at the end of the service might have been a lot more aesthetically pleasing.</td>', 'Flash is ugly here (maybe try boucing it off the ceiling - wood will give a funny colour cast, but that is easier to fix than the dreadful lighting here).   Also not the prettiest of times to shoot - lots of people are distracting, as is the tripod.  Video screens are not pretty.  One or two people in this room at the end of the service might have been a lot more aesthetically pleasing.', '2010-06-10 11:37:54.000000', NULL, 1),
