(6050733, 889672, 97225, '<td valign="top">What a pity that modern society demands safety at all costs. Those handrails really don''t contribute to the grandeur. (That''s not your fault, so no points deducted.)</td>', 'What a pity that modern society demands safety at all costs. Those handrails really don''t contribute to the grandeur. (That''s not your fault, so no points deducted.)', '2010-06-10 22:15:30.000000', NULL, 1),
