(6050739, 889678, 97225, '<td valign="top">I really like this. The colours and light, and here-and-now life, beneath that looming church tower.</td>', 'I really like this. The colours and light, and here-and-now life, beneath that looming church tower.', '2010-06-10 22:20:50.000000', NULL, 1),
