(6050897, 889620, 68947, '<td valign="top">This is stunning and emotive!  The stained glass window light on the prayer subject is just mesmerizing!  My fave in this challenge!!!  Even above my own LOL! :)</td>', 'This is stunning and emotive!  The stained glass window light on the prayer subject is just mesmerizing!  My fave in this challenge!!!  Even above my own LOL! :)', '2010-06-10 23:55:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(6050925, 887980, 66515, '<td valign="top">oh for a cloudless sky when we try this shots! Good attempt though.</td>', 'oh for a cloudless sky when we try this shots! Good attempt though.', '2010-06-11 00:16:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(6050929, 888006, 66515, '<td valign="top">A bit oversharpened as there are some artifacts particularly in the sky. That being said you shot this at the perfect time of night. The reflection is great. I just wish you were back a bit to give more room in the sky above the structure and the reflected sky.</td>', 'A bit oversharpened as there are some artifacts particularly in the sky. That being said you shot this at the perfect time of night. The reflection is great. I just wish you were back a bit to give more room in the sky above the structure and the reflected sky.', '2010-06-11 00:17:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(6050937, 889451, 66515, '<td valign="top">I remember when I was here in 2005. I just didn''t feel right taking pictures in here. Too many ghosts I guess. Ironically I had no problem taking pictures of Ground Zero itself. <br/> <br/>Personal commentary aside this is a great image. It has interesting composition and I like the use of monochrome to help emphasize the soft light and interesting textures of the interior.</td>', 'I remember when I was here in 2005. I just didn''t feel right taking pictures in here. Too many ghosts I guess. Ironically I had no problem taking pictures of Ground Zero itself.  Personal commentary aside this is a great image. It has interesting composition and I like the use of monochrome to help emphasize the soft light and interesting textures of the interior.', '2010-06-11 00:26:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(6050940, 888313, 66515, '<td valign="top">Ow...processing is a bit much. There are strange artifacts, haloing and oversaturation as a result. Its a beautiful building but your processing takes away from it. Also use the full size allowed, you have 800 px (on the longest edge) to work with.</td>', 'Ow...processing is a bit much. There are strange artifacts, haloing and oversaturation as a result. Its a beautiful building but your processing takes away from it. Also use the full size allowed, you have 800 px (on the longest edge) to work with.', '2010-06-11 00:29:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(6050943, 888120, 66515, '<td valign="top">interesting idea but I really have no idea why you have such a harsh halo around the dome of the mosque.</td>', 'interesting idea but I really have no idea why you have such a harsh halo around the dome of the mosque.', '2010-06-11 00:31:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(6050944, 888792, 66515, '<td valign="top">this looks like it should actually be rotated 90 degrees. I keep trying to turn my head sideways to look at it!</td>', 'this looks like it should actually be rotated 90 degrees. I keep trying to turn my head sideways to look at it!', '2010-06-11 00:31:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(6050945, 888308, 66515, '<td valign="top">There is really bad haloing going on and I am not sure what processing technique is responsible but it definitely wasn''t shot this way.</td>', 'There is really bad haloing going on and I am not sure what processing technique is responsible but it definitely wasn''t shot this way.', '2010-06-11 00:32:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(6050947, 888262, 66515, '<td valign="top">A little undersized (use the full 800 px please) and though this is a religious icon its not a church.</td>', 'A little undersized (use the full 800 px please) and though this is a religious icon its not a church.', '2010-06-11 00:32:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(6050948, 888285, 66515, '<td valign="top">processing is pretty harsh on this. I''d be curious to see what this looked like before editing.</td>', 'processing is pretty harsh on this. I''d be curious to see what this looked like before editing.', '2010-06-11 00:32:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(6050949, 889548, 66515, '<td valign="top">The church is here. Somewhere. Its just hidden by a whole bunch of trees.</td>', 'The church is here. Somewhere. Its just hidden by a whole bunch of trees.', '2010-06-11 00:32:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(6050951, 888081, 66515, '<td valign="top">I''m bad for shooting this type of angle too. Straight on is rarely interesting. Shoot this building at a different time of day so you can shoot from a front angle to see what a difference it makes. <br/> <br/>Your submission is also on the small size. Try to use the full size allowed (800 px on the longest side).</td>', 'I''m bad for shooting this type of angle too. Straight on is rarely interesting. Shoot this building at a different time of day so you can shoot from a front angle to see what a difference it makes.  Your submission is also on the small size. Try to use the full size allowed (800 px on the longest side).', '2010-06-11 00:33:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(6050994, 889649, 5822, '<td valign="top">I like IR effects with churches, but I think it goes to waste in this setting because of the lack of any meaningful foliage to show it off. Also, it appears you did not completely convert to B&amp;W as the roof to the left of the steeplechase looks to be in color.</td>', 'I like IR effects with churches, but I think it goes to waste in this setting because of the lack of any meaningful foliage to show it off. Also, it appears you did not completely convert to B&W as the roof to the left of the steeplechase looks to be in color.', '2010-06-11 01:07:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(6050996, 889524, 5822, '<td valign="top">I dislike the framing (church cut off at the bottom) and the perspective distortion (leaning).</td>', 'I dislike the framing (church cut off at the bottom) and the perspective distortion (leaning).', '2010-06-11 01:09:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(6050997, 889575, 5822, '<td valign="top">Uninteresting subject matter, to me.</td>', 'Uninteresting subject matter, to me.', '2010-06-11 01:10:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(6051005, 889597, 5822, '<td valign="top">Assuming your intention was to capture that person walking at slow shutter speed I think you caught him/her at an unfortunate position in the image because he blends into the background too much and is barely noticeable. Also, I would have corrected the color cast.</td>', 'Assuming your intention was to capture that person walking at slow shutter speed I think you caught him/her at an unfortunate position in the image because he blends into the background too much and is barely noticeable. Also, I would have corrected the color cast.', '2010-06-11 01:14:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(6051010, 889765, 5822, '<td valign="top">I like this image for its symmetry and all the detail you were able to capture so sharp. However, the crop is too tight and structure appears too dark, imo.</td>', 'I like this image for its symmetry and all the detail you were able to capture so sharp. However, the crop is too tight and structure appears too dark, imo.', '2010-06-11 01:17:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(6051014, 888795, 5822, '<td valign="top">Though  you have good tonal contrast I believe this image would improve a lot if color contrast was bumped up. Colors are just too drab.</td>', 'Though  you have good tonal contrast I believe this image would improve a lot if color contrast was bumped up. Colors are just too drab.', '2010-06-11 01:19:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(6051018, 889578, 5822, '<td valign="top">Here are the problems I see: color cast, objects blocking my view (street sign, 3-limbed tree, and electrical cables. Perhaps a different view point would have been a better choice.</td>', 'Here are the problems I see: color cast, objects blocking my view (street sign, 3-limbed tree, and electrical cables. Perhaps a different view point would have been a better choice.', '2010-06-11 01:22:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(6051020, 887994, 5822, '<td valign="top">Nice framing, but appears too soft.</td>', 'Nice framing, but appears too soft.', '2010-06-11 01:23:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(6051026, 889875, 5822, '<td valign="top">Excellent water effect adds a lot of interest. I would have liked more if the building on the left was not there.</td>', 'Excellent water effect adds a lot of interest. I would have liked more if the building on the left was not there.', '2010-06-11 01:25:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(6051030, 889654, 5822, '<td valign="top">lol The image itself is not all that interesting or effective to me, but I give you an 7 for your editorial comment.</td>', 'lol The image itself is not all that interesting or effective to me, but I give you an 7 for your editorial comment.', '2010-06-11 01:28:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(6051037, 889478, 5822, '<td valign="top">Love the high key and color contrast here, but wish the gold leaf was sharper.</td>', 'Love the high key and color contrast here, but wish the gold leaf was sharper.', '2010-06-11 01:38:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(6051038, 889673, 5822, '<td valign="top">Could have been more interesting if it weren''t so underexposed and more of the people were better illuminated, but maybe not as it''s so busy as it is.</td>', 'Could have been more interesting if it weren''t so underexposed and more of the people were better illuminated, but maybe not as it''s so busy as it is.', '2010-06-11 01:42:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(6051045, 889554, 5822, '<td valign="top">Nice details captured in the neutrals, but colors are oversaturated, to me.</td>', 'Nice details captured in the neutrals, but colors are oversaturated, to me.', '2010-06-11 01:46:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(6051051, 887786, 5822, '<td valign="top">I like the unique abstract quality and processing done.</td>', 'I like the unique abstract quality and processing done.', '2010-06-11 01:52:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(6051055, 889674, 5822, '<td valign="top">Border is too heavy for my tastes, but I like the composition and lines. A tad underexposed.</td>', 'Border is too heavy for my tastes, but I like the composition and lines. A tad underexposed.', '2010-06-11 01:54:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(6051061, 889853, 5822, '<td valign="top">This could have been a very impressive image if only the wood and metal were better illuminated and detaiil brought out more in post processing.</td>', 'This could have been a very impressive image if only the wood and metal were better illuminated and detaiil brought out more in post processing.', '2010-06-11 01:56:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(6051078, 888146, 5822, '<td valign="top">That''s some impressive wide angle you''ve got there. Wish the image were symmetrical and the people at the bottom just confuse the issue, which is the structure, in my eyes.</td>', 'That''s some impressive wide angle you''ve got there. Wish the image were symmetrical and the people at the bottom just confuse the issue, which is the structure, in my eyes.', '2010-06-11 02:21:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(6051080, 889620, 5822, '<td valign="top">I like how this is lit and the negative space at the bottom.</td>', 'I like how this is lit and the negative space at the bottom.', '2010-06-11 02:22:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(6051082, 889669, 5822, '<td valign="top">Steps are not all that interesting to me.</td>', 'Steps are not all that interesting to me.', '2010-06-11 02:23:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(6051091, 888037, 5822, '<td valign="top">Almost appears to be looking at a convex mirror but the fisheye would have been more effective had you stepped back a couple of feet (if possible) in order to include the complete sides and top of the near pillars.</td>', 'Almost appears to be looking at a convex mirror but the fisheye would have been more effective had you stepped back a couple of feet (if possible) in order to include the complete sides and top of the near pillars.', '2010-06-11 02:34:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(6051095, 889760, 5822, '<td valign="top">I don''t even think I would step foot on the near planks. This (abandoned?) church looks as though it''s been overrun by evil spirits.</td>', 'I don''t even think I would step foot on the near planks. This (abandoned?) church looks as though it''s been overrun by evil spirits.', '2010-06-11 02:38:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(6051098, 889653, 5822, '<td valign="top">Excellent angle of view! creating an abstract with waves of color. This image would benefit greatly with HDR, imo.</td>', 'Excellent angle of view! creating an abstract with waves of color. This image would benefit greatly with HDR, imo.', '2010-06-11 02:42:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(6051099, 889712, 5822, '<td valign="top">A bit eerie, in a good way.</td>', 'A bit eerie, in a good way.', '2010-06-11 02:42:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(6051106, 888118, 5822, '<td valign="top">Good color contrast, but could use a bit more DOF as the distant structure is oof.</td>', 'Good color contrast, but could use a bit more DOF as the distant structure is oof.', '2010-06-11 02:51:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(6051109, 889857, 5822, '<td valign="top">I"m not fond of the angle of view, nor the processing. Too much Topaz(?). Empty sky detracts as well.</td>', 'I"m not fond of the angle of view, nor the processing. Too much Topaz(?). Empty sky detracts as well.', '2010-06-11 02:55:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(6051114, 889630, 5822, '<td valign="top">Interesting design elements but I think you missed the mark on obtaining symmetry as it looks like you captured this a wee bit to the left. Sky is over-saturated to my eye.</td>', 'Interesting design elements but I think you missed the mark on obtaining symmetry as it looks like you captured this a wee bit to the left. Sky is over-saturated to my eye.', '2010-06-11 03:00:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(6051126, 887783, 5822, '<td valign="top">Is this St John the Devine in Harlem? Great place, absolutely beautiful!, but imo you''ve captured a really bad view of it. Why didn''t you shoot a more visible and interesting part of it not blocked by trees?! I know every time I''ve visited there has always been scaffolding to the exterior, but an interior view would have also rocked. On a positive note, your processing skills are very good. Excellent sharpness and detail with good color contrast. I hope to see another try at this in another challenge.</td>', 'Is this St John the Devine in Harlem? Great place, absolutely beautiful!, but imo you''ve captured a really bad view of it. Why didn''t you shoot a more visible and interesting part of it not blocked by trees?! I know every time I''ve visited there has always been scaffolding to the exterior, but an interior view would have also rocked. On a positive note, your processing skills are very good. Excellent sharpness and detail with good color contrast. I hope to see another try at this in another challenge.', '2010-06-11 03:08:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(6051136, 889761, 5822, '<td valign="top">Interesting composition and I like the drama portrayed. Contrast, to mine eye, is too high.</td>', 'Interesting composition and I like the drama portrayed. Contrast, to mine eye, is too high.', '2010-06-11 03:27:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(6051137, 888143, 5822, '<td valign="top">Could use a bump in contrast, otherwise well captured and processed.</td>', 'Could use a bump in contrast, otherwise well captured and processed.', '2010-06-11 03:27:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(6051138, 887980, 5822, '<td valign="top">I like the star trails and pastel colors, but the fence and brick ruin the shot for me.</td>', 'I like the star trails and pastel colors, but the fence and brick ruin the shot for me.', '2010-06-11 03:32:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(6051139, 889526, 5822, '<td valign="top">I think you''ve fallen over the precipice into Topaz hell, but I''m giving you a 7 for its edgy quality.</td>', 'I think you''ve fallen over the precipice into Topaz hell, but I''m giving you a 7 for its edgy quality.', '2010-06-11 03:36:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(6051140, 889675, 5822, '<td valign="top">Composition is pretty good, I''d say, but what does this photo in is the back lighting of the statue because it washes out the sky and creates some vignetting. A difficult exposure but you did good enough to get an 8 from me.</td>', 'Composition is pretty good, I''d say, but what does this photo in is the back lighting of the statue because it washes out the sky and creates some vignetting. A difficult exposure but you did good enough to get an 8 from me.', '2010-06-11 03:40:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(6051142, 889420, 5822, '<td valign="top">The back door is plugged and lacks any detail or interest. There are hot spots in the foliage to create a near IR look (a negative). The composition doesn''t really work for me and neither does the unnecessary elaborate borders.</td>', 'The back door is plugged and lacks any detail or interest. There are hot spots in the foliage to create a near IR look (a negative). The composition doesn''t really work for me and neither does the unnecessary elaborate borders.', '2010-06-11 03:44:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(6051152, 889550, 5822, '<td valign="top">This is a new angle for images of this sort, normally shot symmetrically (I''m kinda ambivalent to it). Focus appears sharpest in the ceiling, but is too dark there to really discern detail well, and where light is shining adequately detail is a bit soft. (Or are my eyes playing tricks on me at 3 in the morning?) Also, is the glass really that purple, or does your lens suffer from really bad chromatic aberration? I''m guessing the former since the rafters appear to be bathed in purple light. Valiant attempt in difficult lighting circumstances.</td>', 'This is a new angle for images of this sort, normally shot symmetrically (I''m kinda ambivalent to it). Focus appears sharpest in the ceiling, but is too dark there to really discern detail well, and where light is shining adequately detail is a bit soft. (Or are my eyes playing tricks on me at 3 in the morning?) Also, is the glass really that purple, or does your lens suffer from really bad chromatic aberration? I''m guessing the former since the rafters appear to be bathed in purple light. Valiant attempt in difficult lighting circumstances.', '2010-06-11 04:00:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(6051154, 889370, 5822, '<td valign="top">Good composition. Also appears that flare is decreasing contrast some.</td>', 'Good composition. Also appears that flare is decreasing contrast some.', '2010-06-11 04:08:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(6051156, 889464, 5822, '<td valign="top">Captured and processed well, but the church holds no visual interest for me. It''s so plain and overshadowed by the dominating skyscrapers that appear to be looking down upon it. I realize you''re presenting a dichotomy but the church can''t compete with the slick looking skyscrapers creating an unbalanced image.</td>', 'Captured and processed well, but the church holds no visual interest for me. It''s so plain and overshadowed by the dominating skyscrapers that appear to be looking down upon it. I realize you''re presenting a dichotomy but the church can''t compete with the slick looking skyscrapers creating an unbalanced image.', '2010-06-11 04:15:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(6051158, 888187, 5822, '<td valign="top">It may not go over that well with many voters, but I like the natural border created by the blown outside facade and the off-centered interior creating a very interesting, if not, quirky crop. Exposure and lighting are right on and the colors are exquisite!  A human presence is good but what''s she doing in that position? Looks like she''s talking to another across the isle. I would have expected you to crop that person out had basic editing allowed you to. Also, you may want to clean up the flare/noise in the lower sides. The last two points will not detract from the score. 8</td>', 'It may not go over that well with many voters, but I like the natural border created by the blown outside facade and the off-centered interior creating a very interesting, if not, quirky crop. Exposure and lighting are right on and the colors are exquisite!  A human presence is good but what''s she doing in that position? Looks like she''s talking to another across the isle. I would have expected you to crop that person out had basic editing allowed you to. Also, you may want to clean up the flare/noise in the lower sides. The last two points will not detract from the score. 8', '2010-06-11 04:18:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(6051161, 888792, 5822, '<td valign="top">This rotated view doesn''t work for me because of the paintings.</td>', 'This rotated view doesn''t work for me because of the paintings.', '2010-06-11 04:28:06.000000', NULL, 1),
