(6051835, 889673, 35044, '<td valign="top">This is a really nice subject - though there are maybe just a few too many people around being a bit distracting.  The exposure is just right for the windows - perhaps a tiny bit more "fill" light required to bring out the stonework.</td>', 'This is a really nice subject - though there are maybe just a few too many people around being a bit distracting.  The exposure is just right for the windows - perhaps a tiny bit more "fill" light required to bring out the stonework.', '2010-06-11 19:21:43.000000', NULL, 1),
