(6053013, 889560, 83313, '<td valign="top">Watch your JPEG compression. I can see obvious compression artifacts around the high contrast edges and some blockiness in the sky. Compression kills detail. At A 71K file size, you had another 230k of file size overhead in order to use less compression. I''m afraid that I''m somewhat anal about compression and seeing such avoidable artifacts does knock some off my vote.</td>', 'Watch your JPEG compression. I can see obvious compression artifacts around the high contrast edges and some blockiness in the sky. Compression kills detail. At A 71K file size, you had another 230k of file size overhead in order to use less compression. I''m afraid that I''m somewhat anal about compression and seeing such avoidable artifacts does knock some off my vote.', '2010-06-13 00:52:12.000000', NULL, 1),
