(6055833, 889655, 83313, '<td valign="top">Decent shot, though I have a couple of nitpicks that may fall in the "personal preference" category, and are not really flaws:<br/> <br/>-I find the crop a tad too tight at the top. A little extra space around the tip of the steeple seems needed to me.<br/> <br/>- The green of the trees seems oversaturated. This is usually caused by too much yellow in the green. I would have taken down the yellow channel a bit to undo some of that dayglo coloration of the foliage.</td>', 'Decent shot, though I have a couple of nitpicks that may fall in the "personal preference" category, and are not really flaws: -I find the crop a tad too tight at the top. A little extra space around the tip of the steeple seems needed to me. - The green of the trees seems oversaturated. This is usually caused by too much yellow in the green. I would have taken down the yellow channel a bit to undo some of that dayglo coloration of the foliage.', '2010-06-14 16:00:59.000000', NULL, 1),
