(6056526, 888313, 15511, '<td valign="top">I remember when you could get a decent landscape shot from the nearby hill that would show the mission alone in the middle of the desert, and it truly stood out. Interesting that there''s almost always a time when the mission was in the middle of repainting. There are many, many cloudless days in Tucson, but the sky has never been that color of blue. I suggest you''ve over-saturated your image.</td>', 'I remember when you could get a decent landscape shot from the nearby hill that would show the mission alone in the middle of the desert, and it truly stood out. Interesting that there''s almost always a time when the mission was in the middle of repainting. There are many, many cloudless days in Tucson, but the sky has never been that color of blue. I suggest you''ve over-saturated your image.', '2010-06-14 22:30:12.000000', NULL, 1),
