(6056810, 889578, 47470, '<td valign="top">I wish you would have popped a flash on the sign to make it stand out more.  I didn''t notice it until after I read the title.</td>', 'I wish you would have popped a flash on the sign to make it stand out more.  I didn''t notice it until after I read the title.', '2010-06-15 06:03:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(6056812, 888795, 47470, '<td valign="top">Did you use a tilt-shift lens?  This looks like a toy model!  I wish the sun had been lower in the sky, creating dramatic shadows as it raked across the graves.</td>', 'Did you use a tilt-shift lens?  This looks like a toy model!  I wish the sun had been lower in the sky, creating dramatic shadows as it raked across the graves.', '2010-06-15 06:09:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(6056813, 889806, 47470, '<td valign="top">The light looks very flat.  It would look less flat if you moved more to the left so we could see two side of the building, one lit side and one shaded side.  I would also back up some so there isn''t so much distortion of the verticals.</td>', 'The light looks very flat.  It would look less flat if you moved more to the left so we could see two side of the building, one lit side and one shaded side.  I would also back up some so there isn''t so much distortion of the verticals.', '2010-06-15 06:14:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(6056817, 889597, 47470, '<td valign="top">I don''t mind the people in the background, but the headless person in the foreground is distracting.  Some sharpening would also make this pop more.</td>', 'I don''t mind the people in the background, but the headless person in the foreground is distracting.  Some sharpening would also make this pop more.', '2010-06-15 06:20:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(6056818, 889762, 47470, '<td valign="top">I think this image would have worked even without the back wall.  That would have put more emphasis on the fountain.</td>', 'I think this image would have worked even without the back wall.  That would have put more emphasis on the fountain.', '2010-06-15 06:21:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(6056820, 889370, 47470, '<td valign="top">I wish you had pulled the greys of the church and the tombstones a little lighter so they would stand out more.  Otherwise, this is a very nice image.  The compotition is perfect and the mood is wonderfully foreboding.</td>', 'I wish you had pulled the greys of the church and the tombstones a little lighter so they would stand out more.  Otherwise, this is a very nice image.  The compotition is perfect and the mood is wonderfully foreboding.', '2010-06-15 06:30:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(6056825, 889478, 47470, '<td valign="top">A little more sharpening would bring out the detail in the gold leaves and contrast the blur of the person.</td>', 'A little more sharpening would bring out the detail in the gold leaves and contrast the blur of the person.', '2010-06-15 07:03:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(6056828, 889731, 47470, '<td valign="top">I like that the cloud makes a halo around the spire.  The light emphasizes the texture of the building perfectly.</td>', 'I like that the cloud makes a halo around the spire.  The light emphasizes the texture of the building perfectly.', '2010-06-15 07:10:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(6056829, 887994, 47470, '<td valign="top">Nice use of a foreground element.  I wish the building were sharper.</td>', 'Nice use of a foreground element.  I wish the building were sharper.', '2010-06-15 07:12:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(6056830, 888313, 47470, '<td valign="top">This looks like a pretty cool building, but the lighting isn''t very good.  Shooting when the sun is lower in the sky would highlight one side of the building and put the other side in shade, which would emphasize the shape of the structure.  It would be worth shooting this one again at a different time of day.</td>', 'This looks like a pretty cool building, but the lighting isn''t very good.  Shooting when the sun is lower in the sky would highlight one side of the building and put the other side in shade, which would emphasize the shape of the structure.  It would be worth shooting this one again at a different time of day.', '2010-06-15 07:16:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(6056831, 889377, 47470, '<td valign="top">This is a cool building, but I wish there were some more light shades.  The majority of the shades are middle grey, dark gray, and black, with very few whites or near-whites.  It gives the building a pretty gloomy or foreboding feel.</td>', 'This is a cool building, but I wish there were some more light shades.  The majority of the shades are middle grey, dark gray, and black, with very few whites or near-whites.  It gives the building a pretty gloomy or foreboding feel.', '2010-06-15 07:18:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(6056832, 887786, 47470, '<td valign="top">Cool perspective.  Almost looks like an abstract.</td>', 'Cool perspective.  Almost looks like an abstract.', '2010-06-15 07:19:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(6056833, 889398, 47470, '<td valign="top">This looks like a wonderful location, but the light doesn''t do it justice.  If this was shot when the sun was low in the sky and casting golden light, this would be absolutely gorgeous.</td>', 'This looks like a wonderful location, but the light doesn''t do it justice.  If this was shot when the sun was low in the sky and casting golden light, this would be absolutely gorgeous.', '2010-06-15 07:20:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(6056845, 888081, 47470, '<td valign="top">I think this might be better if you moved to the right so that we aren''t looking at the building straight on.  Showing a second side of the building would make this look less flat.</td>', 'I think this might be better if you moved to the right so that we aren''t looking at the building straight on.  Showing a second side of the building would make this look less flat.', '2010-06-15 08:14:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(6056848, 888120, 47470, '<td valign="top">This is a wonderful photojournalistic image.</td>', 'This is a wonderful photojournalistic image.', '2010-06-15 08:16:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(6056849, 888285, 47470, '<td valign="top">Even though the lights are blown out, the overall image is underexposed.  The darkness takes away the detail of the lovely organ.  The green hue from the lights also doesn''t make this image very appealing.  Green makes it looks scary, dirty, or foreboding, and that''s probably not how you wanted this to come across.  You could adjust the white balance to fix that.</td>', 'Even though the lights are blown out, the overall image is underexposed.  The darkness takes away the detail of the lovely organ.  The green hue from the lights also doesn''t make this image very appealing.  Green makes it looks scary, dirty, or foreboding, and that''s probably not how you wanted this to come across.  You could adjust the white balance to fix that.', '2010-06-15 08:21:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(6056851, 889765, 47470, '<td valign="top">Nice perspective on a beautiful building.  I wish there were some more whites in the image.  Most of the shades are greys and blacks.</td>', 'Nice perspective on a beautiful building.  I wish there were some more whites in the image.  Most of the shades are greys and blacks.', '2010-06-15 08:23:42.000000', NULL, 1),
