(6058061, 889578, 17507, '<td valign="top">As it happens, I do think before I comment, and I thought before I commented on this photo, too. There is no indication in this photo that the main entrance to the church is downhill, nor of what the arrow is pointing to. The arrow is, in fact, pointing down the hill and out of the frame. Combine this inarguable point with your title and the implications--although evidently not what you intended--are clear. I might suggest that you think about the possible interpretations of your photographs before you submit them. You could also consider taking comments with a grain of salt.</td>', 'As it happens, I do think before I comment, and I thought before I commented on this photo, too. There is no indication in this photo that the main entrance to the church is downhill, nor of what the arrow is pointing to. The arrow is, in fact, pointing down the hill and out of the frame. Combine this inarguable point with your title and the implications--although evidently not what you intended--are clear. I might suggest that you think about the possible interpretations of your photographs before you submit them. You could also consider taking comments with a grain of salt.', '2010-06-16 01:15:56.000000', NULL, 0),
(6058062, 888066, 112635, '<td valign="top">congrats ronald!</td>', 'congrats ronald!', '2010-06-16 01:16:14.000000', NULL, 0),
