(6058088, 889441, 114285, '<td valign="top"><i><u>[i]</u></i>Just upgraded to a Nikon D90 (March 4th 2010). Probably not going to find my way to a ribbon any faster but I think it was time to upgrade.<br/>[/i]<br/>Looks like it worked. Congrats.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2010-06-16 00:22:42.</i></td>', '[i]Just upgraded to a Nikon D90 (March 4th 2010). Probably not going to find my way to a ribbon any faster but I think it was time to upgrade.[/i]Looks like it worked. Congrats.', '2010-06-16 01:21:59.000000', '2010-06-16 01:22:42.000000', 0),
