(6058121, 889441, 17507, '<td valign="top">Way to go! You rocked it with this one. You snagged first place, blasted your old PB out of the water, and let''s not forget, produced a serene and eloquently understated photograph in the process! Congratulations on your blue.</td>', 'Way to go! You rocked it with this one. You snagged first place, blasted your old PB out of the water, and let''s not forget, produced a serene and eloquently understated photograph in the process! Congratulations on your blue.', '2010-06-16 01:31:58.000000', NULL, 0),
