(6058233, 889560, 61778, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Citadel:</b></div><hr/><i> the processing just seem a little off. This is especially evident in the clouds. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>I totally agree. This photo was shot in a 10 minute window between heavy rainstorms, and needed far too much processing to make semi-decent. I would have spot edited the clouds if not for this being a basic editing challenge.</td>', 'Originally posted by Citadel: the processing just seem a little off. This is especially evident in the clouds.   I totally agree. This photo was shot in a 10 minute window between heavy rainstorms, and needed far too much processing to make semi-decent. I would have spot edited the clouds if not for this being a basic editing challenge.', '2010-06-16 01:59:44.000000', NULL, 0),
(6058304, 889441, 99263, '<td valign="top">Proficiat on this well deserved first place. It''s a humdinger of a shot. I especially love the lighting.</td>', 'Proficiat on this well deserved first place. It''s a humdinger of a shot. I especially love the lighting.', '2010-06-16 02:28:43.000000', NULL, 0),
