(6058879, 889370, 41976, '<td valign="top">Thanks for the wonderful comments.  Although I''ve had this member account for years, this was my first (real) entry. And I am patting myself on the back for a strong finish.<br/> <br/>There was a lot of comments on the lack of contrast.  Because this was a basic editing challenge, I had to get the church perfectly right, otherwise it would of been a failure.  I believed I achieved that while still giving the overall shot a feeling of foreboding.<br/> <br/></td>', 'Thanks for the wonderful comments.  Although I''ve had this member account for years, this was my first (real) entry. And I am patting myself on the back for a strong finish. There was a lot of comments on the lack of contrast.  Because this was a basic editing challenge, I had to get the church perfectly right, otherwise it would of been a failure.  I believed I achieved that while still giving the overall shot a feeling of foreboding. ', '2010-06-16 10:12:30.000000', NULL, 0),
