(6059215, 889464, 109245, '<td valign="top">WoW!!! This makes me regret not voting in this challenge.  I have no idea how this didn''t ribbon.  It is wonderful! The creativity, the contrast, the execution, all perfect.  And I think the timing was great, the sky has perfect colors and you can see everything, but it''s not too bright.  I''m glad you didn''t take it later on.  Perfect picture.  My top pick for this challenge =]</td>', 'WoW!!! This makes me regret not voting in this challenge.  I have no idea how this didn''t ribbon.  It is wonderful! The creativity, the contrast, the execution, all perfect.  And I think the timing was great, the sky has perfect colors and you can see everything, but it''s not too bright.  I''m glad you didn''t take it later on.  Perfect picture.  My top pick for this challenge =]', '2010-06-16 13:31:46.000000', NULL, 0),
