(6059987, 889441, 51379, '<td valign="top">Another Blue in Alberta! Well done young man...not bad for a Nikon !  ha ha ...this is the first church I thought of when they announced this challenge , ( I remember recently, they filmed a Jesse James movie there.) However I never got out that way during the Challenge<br/>The upper/lower borders really work well here with that wide crop .... pure genius!  Very well done Congratulations on your first Blue the next one should arrive shortly</td>', 'Another Blue in Alberta! Well done young man...not bad for a Nikon !  ha ha ...this is the first church I thought of when they announced this challenge , ( I remember recently, they filmed a Jesse James movie there.) However I never got out that way during the ChallengeThe upper/lower borders really work well here with that wide crop .... pure genius!  Very well done Congratulations on your first Blue the next one should arrive shortly', '2010-06-16 19:03:12.000000', NULL, 0),
