(6060297, 888285, 68947, '<td valign="top">Judi, I actually thought that this was an very interesting shot and angle to have taken it from.  The processing seemed a little "off" on it but, now that you''ve explained that it was done on a laptop, I can understand how it went this way.  I do all of my editing on a laptop simply because I don''t have a desktop nor, an LCD monitor and I can say that my photos have been not doing well because of it.  I simply cannot see the blow-outs or noise that others see in my shots on LCD or LED monitors. :(</td>', 'Judi, I actually thought that this was an very interesting shot and angle to have taken it from.  The processing seemed a little "off" on it but, now that you''ve explained that it was done on a laptop, I can understand how it went this way.  I do all of my editing on a laptop simply because I don''t have a desktop nor, an LCD monitor and I can say that my photos have been not doing well because of it.  I simply cannot see the blow-outs or noise that others see in my shots on LCD or LED monitors. :(', '2010-06-16 21:24:23.000000', NULL, 0),
