(6061220, 887863, 94815, '<td valign="top">To those commenting on the halos around the branches, it''s not from sharpening but from ACR processing. The halos appeared from the Recovery slider. Maybe I should not have used it but that was the decision at the time. I''ll try a reprocess just for training purposes. Thanks for the comments anyway.</td>', 'To those commenting on the halos around the branches, it''s not from sharpening but from ACR processing. The halos appeared from the Recovery slider. Maybe I should not have used it but that was the decision at the time. I''ll try a reprocess just for training purposes. Thanks for the comments anyway.', '2010-06-17 20:31:02.000000', NULL, 0),
(6061319, 889554, 30982, '<td valign="top">LOL!  Upon first glance I thought you''d left the photomatix watermark from the trial version, and STILL won a ribbon!  Then I realized it was your watermark.  At any rate, I''m terribly jealous of all your most excellent vacation destinations!</td>', 'LOL!  Upon first glance I thought you''d left the photomatix watermark from the trial version, and STILL won a ribbon!  Then I realized it was your watermark.  At any rate, I''m terribly jealous of all your most excellent vacation destinations!', '2010-06-17 22:19:35.000000', NULL, 0),
